return {
    ["        我是罗塞尔·古斯塔夫，但我要记得我真正的姓名——黄涛。\n        这封日记写于我自己的陵墓中，现在的我既没有活着、也没有死去，只是偶尔会获得短暂的清醒。我似乎迷失了很久，只能一遍又一遍回想我挂念的那些东西，让我不要真的被疯狂与污染控制。\n        可笑的是，我曾经拼命搏来的那些荣誉，什么蒸汽机、狗屎蒸汽之子，这些原本就不属于我的东西对稳定认知一点用都没有，只会反噬我。\n        我这辈子真正挂念的，是我的孩子们……\n        夏尔，算算时间他应该已经去世了。死亡是一份礼物，希望他能作为普通人去度过幸福的一生。这是我们其他所有人都无法获得的平静……\n        博诺瓦……该死的蒸汽与机械之神，别让我逮到你！还有查拉图和“门”，等我复活了，我绝对一个个上门好好拜访！我的孩子应当肆意自由地活着，而不是成为神明的傀儡！不知道他那纯粹的神性中，有没有那么一点对我这个父亲的爱……一点点就够了。\n        心爱的贝尔纳黛，应验了查拉图的预言，她终究憎恨、厌弃和离开了我。不知道我被刺杀后她怎么样了……\n        头开始疼了，那家伙的呓语声真是难听。我又得睡了，我不会将这份污染带到这个世界上，这里还有我想守护的东西。哈哈，就跟我一起被封印在这里吧！\n        但我终会归来，只要我的子民还在信仰我，只要我留下的文明与规则没有消逝，只要这个世界还有人记得我的名字……连归来的口号我都想好了——因蒂斯的子民们，你们的皇帝回来了！\n        但在又一次的沉眠前，我似乎看到了一些被我遗忘了许久的东西……炸鸡、可乐、游戏机、家，和好像老去了一些的爸妈……\n        那是或许平凡乏味但再也回不去的人生。\n        故乡啊……"] = "I am Roselle Gustav, but I must remember my real name—Huang Tao. \n This diary was written in my own mausoleum. Right now, I am neither alive nor dead; I only occasionally gain brief moments of clarity. I seem to have been lost for a long time, and I can only recall the things I care about over and over again so that I am not truly controlled by madness and corruption. \n It is ridiculous that the honors I once fought for, all that steam engine stuff, that bullshit Son of Steam, these things that never belonged to me are of no use in stabilizing my cognition and will only backfire on me. \n What I truly care about in this life are my children... \n Charles, calculating the time, he should have passed away by now. Death is a gift; I hope he can spend a happy life as an ordinary person. This is the peace that none of the rest of us can obtain... \n Bernadette... damn God of Steam and Machinery, don't let me catch you! And Zaratul and the \"Door,\" once I am resurrected, I will definitely visit each of you! My children should live freely and wantonly, not become puppets of the gods! I don't know if there is even a little bit of love for me, their father, in that pure divinity of his... a little bit is enough. \n Beloved Bernadette, the prophecy of Zaratul has come true; she eventually hated, abandoned, and left me. I don't know how she is after I was assassinated... \n My head is starting to hurt; that guy's gibberish is really unpleasant. I have to sleep again. I will not bring this corruption into this world; there are still things I want to protect here. Haha, just be sealed here with me! \n But I will eventually return, as long as my people still believe in me, as long as the civilization and rules I left behind have not faded, as long as there is still someone in this world who remembers my name... I have even thought of the slogan for my return—Citizens of Intis, your Emperor has returned! \n But before falling into another slumber, I seem to have seen some things I had forgotten for a long time... fried chicken, cola, game consoles, home, and my parents who seem to have aged a bit... \n That is a life that might have been ordinary and dull but can never be returned to. \n Hometown...",
